      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790664990063,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Jev",
      "fontSize": 47.02044127023182,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Jev",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bm0SYWurLhvUnk6cUfcGQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 322,
      "y": 289,
      "width": 410.2996826171875,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 983628497,
      "version": 276,
      "versionNonce": 1457201983,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790665469087,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> it is a Ai models\n-> but it's not a LLM\n-> jev does'nt generate text\n-> Jev is the ai models build to make fast\n   and structured decision that software \n   can used directly\n-> it's a decisions models and classefier.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> it is a Ai models\n-> but it's not a LLM\n-> jev does'nt generate text\n-> Jev is the ai models build to make fast\n   and structured decision that software \n   can used directly\n-> it's a decisions models and classefier.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "kkvdnWqbeqP7rTVvxWtIr",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 195,
      "y": 536,
      "width": 487.17962646484375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 98547153,
      "version": 236,
      "versionNonce": 835625311,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790665676042,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LLM also do the decision and classefier then why \nwe choose Jev??\n    -> Jev - (i) speed\n               (ii) cost -> token cost is very low",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LLM also do the decision and classefier then why \nwe choose Jev??\n    -> Jev - (i) speed\n               (ii) cost -> token cost is very low",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "a695Iwe_d6bXbTD762rbw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 164.1171875,
      "y": 703.78515625,
      "width": 561.099609375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 827918783,
      "version": 171,
      "versionNonce": 2068624767,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790665957224,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n-> In LLM you can generally ask one question in one query\n-> but in Jev you can ask many question in one query ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n-> In LLM you can generally ask one question in one query\n-> but in Jev you can ask many question in one query ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ljf3y5-pG-AzJvX5VZTSH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 850,
      "y": 279,
      "width": 412.3797607421875,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1471287775,
      "version": 117,
      "versionNonce": 268939711,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790666135067,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> when Jev select any options then they \n   can also tell ---> confidence score of \n   every options",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> when Jev select any options then they \n   can also tell ---> confidence score of \n   every options",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Lh-oWoJmu5FpjDfUlw6dQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 873,
      "y": 398,
      "width": 487.159912109375,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "cross-hatch",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a5",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 984338783,
      "version": 301,
      "versionNonce": 660743359,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790666571588,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "LLM can fake there confidence but in jev\nyou can always they can give accurate\n\nconfidence >= 0.90 --> option will 90% correct\nconfidence 0.60 - 0.90 --> then you can asked\n                                some follow up question\n\nconfidence below 0.60 --> take a help of humman \n                                review",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "LLM can fake there confidence but in jev\nyou can always they can give accurate\n\nconfidence >= 0.90 --> option will 90% correct\nconfidence 0.60 - 0.90 --> then you can asked\n                                some follow up question\n\nconfidence below 0.60 --> take a help of humman \n                                review",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tM8YVrBnBXD5vT3ST0sUG",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 863.1780241505128,
      "y": 728.368991251742,
      "width": 488.4196472167969,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1727339601,
      "version": 56,
      "versionNonce": 348113777,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790666653412,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> Jev can't fake and can't hallucinate the answer",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> Jev can't fake and can't hallucinate the answer",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "b8LOWjRS2ajLt4M0Axk0_",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 866.6465141680176,
      "y": 851.758209349739,
      "width": 453.11968994140625,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
